 "text": [
  {
   "text": "Ian hasn't been home in four years.",
   "at": 0.4,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "pos": "center",
   "size": 50,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "He has a video of his grandmother.",
   "at": 2.883,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "pos": "bar1",
   "size": 40,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "So we brought her into his room.",
   "at": 8.497,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "pos": "bar1",
   "size": 40,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cGrandma, I miss you so much. It's been four years since I've been home.\u201d",
   "at": 14.876,
   "dur": 4.7,
   "pos": "bar1",
   "size": 40,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "B\u00e0 \u01a1i, con nh\u1edb b\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1eafm. 4 n\u0103m r\u1ed3i con ch\u01b0a v\u1ec1.",
   "at": 14.876,
   "dur": 4.7,
   "pos": "bar2",
   "size": 22,
   "color": "#a1a1a6",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cI know, dear. I miss you every day. Tell me what you're doing!\u201d",
   "at": 19.926,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "pos": "bar1",
   "size": 40,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "B\u00e0 bi\u1ebft, con. B\u00e0 nh\u1edb con t\u1eebng ng\u00e0y. H\u00e3y cho b\u00e0 bi\u1ebft con \u0111ang l\u00e0m g\u00ec nh\u00e9!",
   "at": 19.926,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "pos": "bar2",
   "size": 22,
   "color": "#a1a1a6",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "AI voice, cloned with her family's consent",
   "at": 19.926,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "pos": "upper",
   "size": 20,
   "color": "#a1a1a6",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bobby Fischer",
   "at": 83.397,
   "dur": 17.256999999999998,
   "pos": "left-top",
   "size": 26,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "Magnus Carlsen",
   "at": 83.397,
   "dur": 17.256999999999998,
   "pos": "right-top",
   "size": 26,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stockfish at Fischer's peak rating. Not affiliated.",
   "at": 83.397,
   "dur": 17.256999999999998,
   "pos": "left-low",
   "size": 18,
   "color": "#d2d2d7",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stockfish at Carlsen's peak rating. Not affiliated.",
   "at": 83.397,
   "dur": 17.256999999999998,
   "pos": "right-low",
   "size": 18,
   "color": "#d2d2d7",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "Roger Federer's likeness. AI opponent, not affiliated.",
   "at": 107.583,
   "dur": 3.8860000000000015,
   "pos": "lower-right",
   "size": 20,
   "color": "#d2d2d7",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "His likeness, from his footage. Not affiliated.",
   "at": 114.726,
   "dur": 5.313999999999998,
   "pos": "lower-right",
   "size": 20,
   "color": "#d2d2d7",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "Real footage, rebuilt in 3D. Not affiliated with the NBA or the players.",
   "at": 120.54,
   "dur": 12.257000000000014,
   "pos": "lower-right",
   "size": 20,
   "color": "#d2d2d7",
   "weight": "medium"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cHey Vishal, how are you doing?\u201d",
   "at": 141.14,
   "dur": 1.9,
   "pos": "lower",
   "size": 40,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cHey! Not much, just excited to chat and share about Lucid Dreams. How about you?\u201d",
   "at": 144.54,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "pos": "lower",
   "size": 34,
   "color": "#f5f5f7",
   "weight": "semibold"
  },
  {
   "text": "AI voice \u00b7 his own, cloned with his consent",
   "at": 144.54,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "pos": "lower2",
   "size": 22,
   "color": "#a1a1a6",
   "weight": "medium"
  }
